Third-party data in this folder

These three files embed copies of the Secured Overnight Financing Rate (SOFR)
monthly averages shipped in examples/sofr-monthly-v1.json, as the dated rate
path of the seeded setups they hold:

  replica/inputs/deposit-forms-v1.json
  replica/inputs/feature-demos-v1.json
  replica/inputs/survival-path-v1.json

They are the same data under the same terms. The files carry no notice field
of their own; this notice applies to the SOFR values in each of them.

Source: Federal Reserve Bank of New York, Secured Overnight Financing Rate
[SOFR], retrieved from FRED, Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis:
https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/SOFR. Retrieved 2026-11-03.

